WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.417 --> 00:00:02.419
If I was a rational person,

00:00:02.503 --> 00:00:05.547
I would have dropped out of
this race a long time ago.

00:00:05.797 --> 00:00:09.343
Crowley hasn't had a primary
challenger in 14 years.

00:00:09.426 --> 00:00:12.721
He has taken $3,000,000
per cycle.

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:14.640
He's gonna tell me I'm small,

00:00:14.723 --> 00:00:17.351
that I'm young,
that I'm inexperienced.

00:00:23.815 --> 00:00:26.360
My mom cleaned houses
growing up.

00:00:26.443 --> 00:00:28.654
I never really saw myself
going into politics.

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:31.865
Americans aren't asking
for a lot.

00:00:32.115 --> 00:00:35.494
They're asking for politicians
to help them get by.

00:00:35.827 --> 00:00:37.621
-I can do this.
-I know you can.

00:00:43.919 --> 00:00:45.837
We're doing something
very controversial.

00:00:46.088 --> 00:00:48.048
People say, "How dare you
mount a challenge

00:00:48.131 --> 00:00:49.591
to someone
who is so established?"

00:00:52.553 --> 00:00:54.137
It's not just our family.

00:00:54.221 --> 00:00:56.682
It's 30,000 families a year

00:00:57.099 --> 00:01:00.185
losing loved ones because
they don't have insurance.

00:01:00.978 --> 00:01:03.063
I was not trying
to become an activist.

00:01:03.647 --> 00:01:05.482
I live six minutes
from Ferguson.

00:01:08.944 --> 00:01:11.613
Being a woman of color,
our image is scrutinized.

00:01:12.197 --> 00:01:14.157
People in my district,
this is how we look.

00:01:15.325 --> 00:01:17.452
I come from a long line
of coal miners.

00:01:17.536 --> 00:01:19.413
We've been collateral damage.

00:01:19.746 --> 00:01:20.789
They underestimate us.

00:01:21.248 --> 00:01:23.375
I'm running because
everyday Americans

00:01:23.458 --> 00:01:26.628
deserve to be represented
by everyday Americans.

00:01:28.547 --> 00:01:31.466
I'm not going to allow
my daughter

00:01:31.550 --> 00:01:33.176
to have died for nothing.

00:01:35.721 --> 00:01:39.224
The problems we have in our
district, we ourselves can fix.

00:01:39.516 --> 00:01:43.061
I get scared of the cynicism
from people

00:01:43.145 --> 00:01:45.814
really believing in something
and then it not working out.

00:01:47.316 --> 00:01:48.734
I just don't want to&nbsp;
let them down.

00:01:51.612 --> 00:01:52.946
You have to be fearless,

00:01:53.071 --> 00:01:54.281
or they're going to
come after you.

00:01:54.364 --> 00:01:55.657
Nobody owns you yet.

00:01:57.117 --> 00:02:00.370
No matter what the outcome,
it will never be the same.

00:02:00.454 --> 00:02:02.039
We're going to fight
for each other.

00:02:04.916 --> 00:02:06.627
Some of us
have got to get through.

00:02:06.752 --> 00:02:08.086
It's about the whole movement.

